{"sourceUrl":"http://www.rse.neu.edu.cn/2025/0701/c2147a288720/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:48.581775+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.rse.neu.edu.cn/2025/0701/c2147a288720/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>为帮助考生深入了解我院研究生教育特色、招生政策及培养优势等情况，学院将开展</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年研究生招生宣传活动，通过线上线下相结合的方式，为同学们提供全方位咨询服务。现将具体安排通知如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、</span></span><span>线上宣传活动</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span>直播宣讲会：学院院长、学科带头人将在线解读招生政策、专业特色、导师团队及就业前景</span><span><span>等内容</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>时间</span><span><span>安排</span></span><span>：</span></span></span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span>日</span><span><span>上午</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>平台：学校官网、微信公众号、抖音</span><span>/B</span><span>站官方号（支持回放）</span></p><p><span><span>二、线下宣传活动</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>校园开放日：参观校园学习生活、聆听学术讲座、与导师面对面交流等。为保证活动效果，参加线下活动的外校优秀学生人数不超过</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>人，基本申请条件如下：</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>全日制</span></span><span>应届本科毕业生</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>本科期间学习成绩优秀，</span><span><span>预计获得</span></span><span>推荐</span><span><span>免试资格</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>）本科专业包括</span><span><span>机</span></span><span>器人工程、自动化、人工智能等相关专业。</span></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）原则上通过国家大学外语四级考试（四级成绩达到</span><span>425</span><span>分以上）。</span></p><p><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>报名程序。符合申请条件，有意向参加线下活动</strong></span></span><span><span>的同学可以在</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日中午</span></span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span><span>通过扫描下方二维码填写申请信息（扫描前请通过官方网站下载钉钉</span></span><span><span>APP</span></span><span><span>），学院将按照审核规则对报名同学进行资格初审，初审合格的同学将于</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日收到短信通知，收到短信后请按短信通知内容按时操作，逾期未反馈的，将视为放弃活动资格。</span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/aee3ff10990aa922a9b1.jpg\"/></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>活动日程</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日下午  报到（报到地点另行通知）</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日上午  招生宣讲</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日下午  学术交流</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日上午  参观校园，返程</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：最终行程安排详见活动当天会序手册。</span></span></p><p><span><span>三、其它</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）我院为</span><span><span>全体同学</span></span><span>统一安排用餐，外校</span><span><span>同学安排</span></span><span>住宿。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（二）就读沈阳市以外高校</span></span><span><span>同学</span></span><span><span>，若最终</span></span><span><span>确认录取我校</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生</span></span><span><span>可报销</span></span><span><span>活动期间</span></span><span><span>往返路费，</span></span><span><span>入学后统一办理报销事宜</span></span><span><span>，限火车硬座</span></span></span></span><span>/</span><span>硬卧、高铁</span><span>/</span><span><span><span>动车二等座</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>最终报销将按我校计划财经处规定执行。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三）学院将为</span><span><span>全体同学</span></span><span>办理活动期间人身意外保险，在</span><span><span>学术交流日</span></span><span>活动期间因个人行为导致的意外事故及产生的医疗费用，由</span><span><span>其</span></span><span>本人承担。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>考生如有意向在上述活动日程（线下活动）外参观东北大学校园，可在学校开放的出入口（</span></span><span><span><strong>南湖校区开放南门北门西门；浑南校区开放东门西门</strong></span></span><span><span>）刷取本人身份证出入校园，驾车出入校园的可通过关注“平安东北大学”，依次点击入校预约</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>校外车辆入校备案，填写相关信息履行备案程序即可驾车出入校园。校园限速</span></span><span><span>25km/h</span></span><span><span>，请注意交通安全。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.rse.neu.edu.cn/2025/0701/c2147a288720/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>四、联系渠道</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联 系 人：</span><span><span>冯</span></span><span>老师</span></span></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>024-83656512</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>fengdehui@mail.neu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>联系部门：机器人科学与工程学院综合办公室</span></p><p><span><span><span>办公地点：</span><span><span>东北大学</span></span><span>浑南校区建筑学馆</span></span></span><span>B209</span></p><p><span>本方案解释权属东北大学机器人科学与工程学院。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>相关链接：</span></span></p><p><span>东北大学研究生招生信息网：</span><a href=\"http://yz.neu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://yz.neu.edu.cn/</span></a><span>；</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>机器人科学与工程</span></span><span>学院网站：</span></span></span><a href=\"http://www.rse.neu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.rse.neu.edu.cn/</span></a></p><p><span><span><span>愿广大</span><span><span>同学</span></span><span>通过本次</span><span><span>学术交流日</span></span><span>活动了解东北大学，了解东</span><span>北大学</span><span><span>机器人科学与工程</span></span><span>学院，感受白山黑水的校园环境和深厚的人文底蕴。欢迎广大优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>东北大学</span><span><span>机器人科学与工程</span></span><span>学院</span></span></span></p><p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"c34afc50e19888873be40ba9305408c86b4fe0fdcfd320f53fc66225e1dc211a","textLength":1295,"sourceSha256":"d63a8f52e1ae34ae8d41235d6296e4bad0bfa52fe28865d8ef48ed623f606717","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9a109a422a5a5ffe34b5","title":"2025年东北大学机器人科学与工程学院 2025年研究生招生宣传活动周的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:48.581775+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.rse.neu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/0c/f0/9cc88d1146a795cf158c868a54b8/43afbc2f-4d7b-4f8f-b030-3233333334d4.jpg","file":"assets/articles/media/aee3ff10990aa922a9b1.jpg"}]}
